Output docs/demo/dashboard.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' PATH="$PWD/target/release:$PATH"` Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "grainx --hide-processes" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 25s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
